{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeaNdVZhAwDPqz7MhLxuQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015WQfiSoBW3KUsX31mupadd","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://kubernetes.io/releases/version-skew-policy/","prompt":"Transcribe this page VERBATIM as markdown. Do not summarize or paraphrase — downstream audits verify facts against your exact output.\n\nReproduce in full and word for word: the opening \"Supported versions\" section (including the exact statement of how many minor releases are supported and the patch release support window in months), \"Supported version skew\" and every subsection — \"kube-apiserver\", \"kubelet\", \"kube-proxy\", \"kube-controller-manager, kube-scheduler, and cloud-controller-manager\", \"kubectl\" — including every example listing specific versions (e.g. \"kube-apiserver is at 1.34 ... kubelet is supported at 1.34, 1.33, 1.32, and 1.31\"), and the entire \"Supported component upgrade order\" section with all its subsections.\n\nReproduce every numeric version and every \"n-1\", \"n-2\", \"n-3\" style statement exactly as written. Include any note admonitions verbatim.\n\nAlso state verbatim any sentence on the page about long-term support (LTS) if one exists; if the page never mentions LTS, write: NO LTS STATEMENT ON THIS PAGE."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21610,"cache_read_input_tokens":73038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21610},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e4cae61e-42df-484d-af84-1dcbf8c0a281","uuid":"27d7945e-299e-40cf-b2d0-d02bde6f9387","timestamp":"2026-08-31T06:45:04.009Z","request_id":"req_011CeaNdUVCk3aEnxsdWkaMT"}
