{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"icas and resources to meet customer demand.\"\n\n> \"You can also view the resource metrics using the `kubectl top` command.\"\n\n> Note: \"The Metrics API, and the metrics pipeline that it enables, only offers the minimum CPU and memory metrics to en"}},"session_id":"e4cae61e-42df-484d-af84-1dcbf8c0a281","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"fe05c14e-1b76-43c9-9b67-e08a74b6a4d1"}
