{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" kernels). The time window used to calculate CPU is shown under window field in Metrics API.\"\n\n### Memory\n\n> \"Memory is reported as the working set, measured in bytes, at the instant the metric was collected.\"\n\n> \"In an ideal world, the 'working set' is the amount of"}},"session_id":"e4cae61e-42df-484d-af84-1dcbf8c0a281","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"883f8947-f47a-4d0e-87c5-b7d15b84fd6b"}
